      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹17.21 (up from ₹17.10 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹20.9b (up 49% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹2.92b (flat on FY 2025). Profit margin: 14% (down from 21% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 5% per year whereas the company’s share price has fallen by 4% per year.",
